ode_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-12-03T15:04:16Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:36:19Z","closed_at":"2025-12-04T03:06:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113512","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113512.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113512.patch","merged_at":"2025-12-04T03:06:59Z"},"body":"This PR introduces a huge quality of life improvement in terms of editing text that is supposed to be read with a monospaced font.\r\n\r\n- Add hint string `monospace` for `PROPERTY_HINT_{NONE,PASSWORD,PLACEHOLDER_TEXT}` to set the `LineEdit` font monospaced.\r\n- Add hint string `monospace` for `PROPERTY_HINT_MULTILINE_TEXT` to set the `TextEdit` font monospaced.\r\n- Add hint string `no_wrap` for `PROPERTY_HINT_MULTILINE_TEXT` to make the `TextEdit` not wrap lines automatically.\r\n\r\nAlso:\r\n- Fix issue with `EditorPropertyMultilineText` not updating font properly.\r\n- Add `EditorPropertyMultilineText` tweak flags.\r\n- Add support with GDScript `@export_multiline`.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| :---: | :---: |\r\n| <img width=\"644\" height=\"306\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-12-03 à 09 56 26\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef4c851c-0e03-4b46-83e7-92367292adf0\" /> | <img width=\"1288\" height=\"544\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca9f9355-a9c1-4492-91c0-039df96ab21e\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"1178\" height=\"355\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-12-03 à 10 18 58\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/759312c1-5d68-4a0c-b8ff-db6855df9fda\" /> | <img width=\"1197\" height=\"328\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-12-03 à 11 26 33\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d851c56a-0909-4abc-90cd-1d470c367d81\" /><br><em>Please note <span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><code>\"nowrap\"</code></span> has been changed to <span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><code>\"no_wrap\"</code></span>.</em> |\r\n| <img width=\"871\" height=\"230\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-12-03 à 11 21 50\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7de5179c-b72f-4370-9bc6-7e1f959dbe95\" /> | <img width=\"900\" height=\"289\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-12-03 à 11 06 35\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61d7705b-04a9-40e8-b643-2d732c0c6761\" /> |\r\n\r\nI took a look at which properties of the export plugins would benefit from monospaced text, and I added the new hint string on them.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAlso, this PR:\r\n\r\n- Fixes issue with `EditorPropertyMultilineText` not updating font properly.\r\n- ~~Adds `EditorPropertyMultilineText` tweak flags.~~\r\n- Adds support with GDScript `@export_multiline`.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> I didn't update `@export` as it may require a little bit more thinking than exposing `hints` to `@export_multiline`.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113512/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113512/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}